Alembic migration environment for the AI.R internal system.

The database URL is read from application settings (app.config), not from
alembic.ini, so migrations always target the same database as the app.

Common commands (run from the project root with the venv active):

    alembic upgrade head            # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1            # roll back one migration
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"   # generate a new migration
    alembic history                 # list migrations
    alembic current                 # show current DB revision
